{"id":"jyq35p7ml4crvp1wwmszby6bb","title":"贝莱德提交比特币下行保护ETF申请，挂钩IBIT并设收益上限","originalTitle":null,"summary":"贝莱德旗下iShares信托于10月19日向美国SEC提交iShares Bitcoin Managed Protection ETF注册申请，基金代码为PBIT。该基金挂钩IBIT等比特币敞口，通过分批买入比特币期权并卖出期权抵消成本，从而设置上行收益上限，同时利用固定收益产品利息对冲期权成本并提供下行保护。","reason":"原文给出了PBIT策略的具体结构，包括期权对冲、收益上限和下行保护机制，便于理解这类产品的收益边界与风险来源。","source":{"name":"PANews"},"links":{"original":"https://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a1562c-0300-7521-a177-81671a42a7dc"},"publishedAt":"2026-10-19T21:58:07.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-10-19T22:25:18.842Z","timelineAt":"2026-10-19T22:25:18.842Z","category":"crypto-market","tags":["产品上线","ETF","比特币","Bitcoin"],"score":85,"selected":true,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"ff10348a-5b3c-477d-9eb7-e3f03f2fc662","title":"贝莱德申报比特币下行保护ETF（PBIT），通过期权和固收策略限制下行风险"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"ff10348a-5b3c-477d-9eb7-e3f03f2fc662","title":"贝莱德申报比特币下行保护ETF（PBIT），通过期权和固收策略限制下行风险"}],"topics":[{"slug":"bitcoin","name":"比特币 / BTC"},{"slug":"blackrock","name":"BlackRock / 贝莱德"},{"slug":"etf","name":"加密 ETF"},{"slug":"crypto-market","name":"行情异动"}],"indexable":true,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fdgXDGJ_Vi0w","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}